// Test: Variable tracking prevents redeclaration
// Spec: 17-JORMUNGANDR-BOOTSTRAP.md § CG-004 Variable Tracking
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that variable assignments don't redeclare of generated C.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print 10

rite main() {
    ≔ vary x: !i32 = 0;
    x = 5;
    x = 10;
    println(x);
}
